subject: Your Detag password was changed

--- text ---
Hi,

Your Detag password was changed. As a precaution, 2 other session(s) were signed out — only your current session stays signed in.

If this was not you, reset your password immediately and check your signed-in sessions. If it was you, no action is needed.

— The Detag team

